# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Paper-trading keys only -- see CLAUDE.md and
# semis_paper_trading_brief.md's "Never trade live" boundary. This project has no live
# key, live code path, or live config option anywhere.
#
# Get paper keys from the Alpaca dashboard (https://app.alpaca.markets/paper/dashboard) --
# each paper account has its own key pair, separate from any live account's keys.
ALPACA_API_KEY=
ALPACA_SECRET_KEY=
